WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.410
My dear Katakura,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.540
the remaining time allotted to you grows short.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:13.460
I want you to decide what
your answer is by the time I return.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.680
So you're heading out to take down Mori of Aki?

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.170
That was what the alliance
was for in the first place, right?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.380
Though, I'm sure the same could
be said for Mori Motonari, too.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.720
By the sound of it, the main army headed east.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.730
Likely for Odawara.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.930
Other than the detachment under you,

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.610
you probably have two or three more
forces about as big as the main army.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.560
So you mean to finish this.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.490
There are only two paths for you to choose from.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.410
Serve the Toyotomi for the sake
of the land of the rising sun to come

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.830
or continue to wander aimlessly

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.410
in pursuit of the dear boy Masamune's ghost.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.710
You would hardly do anything so
foolish as to defy Hideyoshi alone.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.710
There's one more path, Takenaka.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.590
Having broken through the cheap
trap you and that Matsunaga bastard set,

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.260
the Date will crush the Toyotomi.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.890
That is not realistic.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.100
I don't believe

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:12.430
that Lord Matsunaga will bury the
dear boy Masamune for me, either.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.060
Nor do I think he has any intention of doing so.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.440
Ultimately, his role is nothing
more than to force a standstill.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:20.490
Until my return.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.480
I don't know whose man he is,

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.730
but thanks to him, it's made our job easier.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.110
Depending on his objective,
we may also bump heads.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:33.620
The breadth of Toyotomi's
strategy is beyond what we'd imagined.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.540
Unless we initiate a raid and find
out what they're really planning...

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.960
Master Katakura!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:55.310
Sarutobi!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.730
We'll just say you owe me one.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:00.770
They seem to have left
enough troops to guard the castle.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.440
It'll be fine as long as
we don't make a commotion.

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:23.460
This is it.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.420
The thing headed this way from Aki

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.550
is the mobile fortress that was in the reports.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.050
It must be Chosokabe's
Fugaku, which Mori rebuilt.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:34.260
They'd even taken into account
that they'd steal it in the end

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.720
and that's why the Toyotomi
offered the Mori an alliance.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.940
What?

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.510
I see...

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:43.980
And for Mori's part,
he intends to attack Osaka.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.650
They are both formidable.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.020
Master Katakura,

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.900
does this mean they're sending
troops to the far north by sea?

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.610
They mean to attack Uesugi from behind.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:57.240
There's a force on the
north side of Kyushu, too.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.920
So this is the force sent to subdue Satsuma.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.090
What kind of lineup do they have?

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.910
This wouldn't be remotely
possible for anyone but the Toyotomi.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:07.340
It's literally an all-out war.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:09.040
Lord Kenshin...

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.840
Go fly to him immediately and let him know.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.920
I appreciate it...

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.630
So Matsunaga's here.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.230
I heard that man was alive.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:20.600
That Takenaka bastard...

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.150
He used Matsunaga to block the Date

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:27.480
and now he plans to crush them both
with the fortress he stole from Mori.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.030
Take this with you.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.780
Unarmed, even you can't...

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.070
--Sarutobi!
--Sasuke!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.940
Ow, that hurt...

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:13.520
I know, you're that legendary ninja, aren't you?

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:15.230
Fuma Kotaro!

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.620
You go, Kasuga!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.790
If you don't hurry, the War God's
going to be attacked from behind!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.590
Sarutobi, that sword!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.290
You, too, Master Katakura! Go!

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.260
Sasuke...

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.350
Sarutobi, get rid of the sword!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.730
He works for Matsunaga!

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.330
He's after that sword!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.240
What? For real?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.620
Then why didn't you say so in the first place?!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.080
Go get it!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.430
Let us out, damn you!

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.600
Don't you mess with us pirates!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:28.230
We're gonna avenge the
Boss's death, without fail!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.740
Avenge the Boss!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.370
Oh-ho, so you survived.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.830
So you intend to head for Odawara? Excellent.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:57.640
Please pay no attention to me.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.260
Matsunaga!

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:00.810
He's really alive!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:03.980
Bastard... Why did you do that to us?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.400
You're not the sort to
play toady to the Toyotomi.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:12.270
My nature is such that I immediately
forget any promises I make

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.900
with anyone whom I do not
believe can credibly trust me.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.820
It takes energy to remember things.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.450
Pompous as ever!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.900
You'll pay for what you did.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.200
Good work.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.330
Mikazuki Munechika.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.130
I was currently in the mood to admire this piece

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.760
rather than the famed sword Otenta

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:41.930
and the numerous other treasures
that were listed, and so I took it.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.220
With this famed sword as my side dish,

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:47.930
I think I shall enjoy a drink
from the Demon King's skull tonight.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.640
Eh?!

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:54.360
And now, you will have to excuse me.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.490
Damn...

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.070
Lord Masamune!

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.460
M-Master Katakura!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:12.040
Kojuro...

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.430
You're Chosokabe Motochika, aren't you?

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.850
You bet.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.520
A battle to avenge your
death has started in Osaka Castle.

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.640
They're overwhelmingly outnumbered.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.350
You should go to them quickly.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.270
Boss!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.850
Is that right?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.480
Looks like this can't wait.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.820
After I've saved my precious sons
of bitches, I'll follow you to Odawara...

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.370
Or so I'd like to say, but...

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.240
You guessed it.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:52.620
It'll probably be over
by the time you get there.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:53.670
One-Eyed Dragon.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.540
Eh?

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.420
Don't go croaking on me.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:00.130
Sure thing.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.430
Next time we meet, let's treat
ourselves to a party on the sea!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.720
Good luck!

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.050
You got it!

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.930
You take care, too!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.850
Here we go, you sons of bitches!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:14.150
We head for Osaka!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.190
Lord Masamune.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.150
This blunder I committed...

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.950
I don't care about that.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.780
You did well to come back.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.620
Master Katakura!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:34.420
Mori's fortress is closing in from the west.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.240
The Toyotomi intend to steal it,

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.500
and along with the main
army that headed for Odawara

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.630
and a separate force that
was stationed to the north,

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.510
they plan to take control of the
Kanto region from three directions.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.180
Since we're outnumbered,

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.760
the only option we have is
to beat them to the punch.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.260
Is that it?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.890
Precisely.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:53.940
Please leave it to me.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:58.640
I, Kojuro, will protect your back, without fail!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.320
Master Katakura!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.950
All right. I'll be counting on you, Kojuro.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.030
That scar on your back...

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:14.370
It could not have come from Hideyoshi's fists.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.580
Takenaka Hanbei!

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.330
My dear boy Motonari.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:28.140
There's no need for large armies
or battles to defeat the Mori.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:32.930
Your men feel no devotion for you,
so all it will take is for you to fall.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:37.640
Your pawns will neither mourn
nor grieve for their lord's death

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:42.190
and they will surely surrender
meekly to us, the Toyotomi.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.740
Toyotomi...

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:46.440
Waiting for the Devil King
of the Sixth Heaven to perish,

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:48.790
he now aims to conquer
the country in Oda's place.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:51.910
When all is said and done,
a beast scavenging upon carrion.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.960
Congratulations, Lord Mori.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:59.040
Before long, the whole of the land
of the rising sun is sure to be Aki's.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:04.340
At present, we have but to advance
this fortress, the Sun, to Osaka.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:06.290
Please, have a drink.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.190
M-Master Akagawa!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.850
L-Lord Mori, what are you doing?!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.310
Have you gone mad?!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:24.610
Then you try drinking that sake.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.310
Yes, Sir...

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.540
Akagawa Motoyasu.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:48.500
The fact that you were a Toyotomi spy

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:51.760
was part of my calculations from the start.

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:54.590
You wanted to have this
opportunity to assassinate me,

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:59.400
and as a result, you worked
hard for me to the very end.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:04.900
Takenaka Hanbei, your
sacrificial pawn proved quite useful.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.580
I have finally come to a realization.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:16.450
That I, Yukimura, have done
nothing but follow you from behind

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.910
and that I have not been truly
looking upon the future you desire

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.620
together with you, my lord.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:27.380
I should not be helping because
it is the future that my lord envisions.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:36.680
It should be because I, too,
share the same aspirations...

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.230
Because I, too, see the same future...

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:43.930
That is why I should burn,
be spirited, and fight by your side!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.690
That is how it should be!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:52.440
For the world without war
that lies beyond tomorrow.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:56.240
My lord, I, Yukimura, feel that I have finally

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:01.580
made your teachings a part of my
own flesh and blood in some small way!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:04.410
I cannot be the tiger cub forever!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.420
I, too, must aspire to someday...

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:09.630
...be the Tiger of Kai!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.590
The signal flare has not gone up!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.510
And it is showing no signs of stopping.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.430
Could it be that he was discovered?!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.560
Has Master Takenaka still not arrived?

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.390
I believe we should retreat for now!

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:27.440
Start up the main cannon, the Day Star's Ray!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.140
Yes, Sir!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.330
Toyotomi.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:43.200
I will show you!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:46.160
That is Chosokabe's Fugaku.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.000
No, it is not...

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:49.710
Fire!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:13.820
This is my flawless plan.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:18.900
Even Toyotomi Hideyoshi,
who singlehandedly sank the Fugaku,

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.240
will not be able to thwart

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.320
the main cannon that the
Sun boasts, the Day Star's Ray.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:27.540
In the face of a power that none
can so much as lay a finger upon,

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.540
strength will be meaningless!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:32.970
The power of the sun and
I have its divine protection.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.590
Which is to say...

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:38.260
It is inevitable that I shall conquer this land!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.510
What is that thing?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.810
There is no way to fight that thing.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.390
But it must be stopped.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:47.140
Please follow me!

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.640
Yes, Sir!

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.150
What to do?

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.320
If he employs such a weapon,

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:55.020
the land of the rising sun will be
reduced to ashes before we know it!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:58.830
At around the same time, the
main Toyotomi army led by Hideyoshi

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.410
was advancing towards Odawara,

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.990
the foothold for gaining
supremacy over the Kanto region.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:12.960
Hideyoshi.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:18.550
I will stop you!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:29.140
If you're going to rely on
strength and strength alone...

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.580
Nene.

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:57.170
Wake up, Hideyoshi!

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:00.760
If you don't acknowledge the weakness in you...

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.680
If you don't come to know the weakness in you...

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.680
...you can never be truly strong!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:09.600
The things you cherish
may become your weaknesses,

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.430
but those things...

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:14.440
Those things make you
stronger like nothing else can!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.390
The thing most precious to you...

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:19.110
The thing that you ought
to risk your life to protect...

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.570
And to have obliterated it yourself?!

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.780
Please wake up, Hideyoshi!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.610
Go back to the old you...

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.620
Please go back to being the true you!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:51.100
Long time no see, One-Eyed Dragon.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:55.850
Just when do you plan to
wield that sword in earnest?

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:59.480
I'm always in earnest.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.490
Always.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:05.160
If you use force to subdue
everything and anything,

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:08.080
the fighting will never end.

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:09.910
You know,

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.370
people only need to feel
connected in the smallest ways

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:15.580
to make us want to not hurt each other.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:19.760
Don't you think that's how people are, too?

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.710
One-Eyed Dragon?

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:25.050
Even if it's someone
you've just met by chance...

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:26.600
Why...

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:30.220
Why are people forever just...

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:33.930
Why, of all people, did he have to...

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:39.230
You didn't run away.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.400
That much, I get.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:42.730
And...

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.320
Also that the bastard called Toyotomi Hideyoshi

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:49.620
is apparently exactly the
kind of man I thought he was.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:55.080
I don't know what your relationship is with him,

00:18:55.170 --> 00:19:01.170
but don't tell me that he used
to be a good guy way back when.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:02.720
I won't.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.260
Let him rest there.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.560
That softie fought with all his might.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:13.310
He got knocked out, but he's no loser.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:22.770
What will you do, Sanada Yukimura?

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:25.150
Riding on my judgment and my orders

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.900
is the fate of not only the Takeda cavalry,

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.780
but also of the troops
Lord Shimazu entrusted to me.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.110
Master!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.790
Looks like things turned
out superbly in Satsuma.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.250
Ah, Sasuke!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:38.830
Hideyoshi has headed for
Odawara with the main army.

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:41.710
Uesugi has Utsunomiya contained,

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:45.840
but an army Toyotomi had hidden in
the far north is closing in from behind.

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:48.260
It looks like a force about
the same size as the main army

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.090
was also sent to Kyushu.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.470
They mean to take the country
in one fell swoop for sure this time.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.930
But at Osaka Castle, Chosokabe's
men, who were being held captive,

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:02.640
have begun rampaging, prepared
to go down fighting for their master.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.120
And having rendezvoused with Master Katakura,

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:09.410
the One-Eyed Dragon should be
going after Hideyoshi to Odawara.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.240
Master, Takeda's main army
is the reserve force right now.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.370
Want to ask the commander for reinforcements?

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:21.880
No, I would like my lord to watch over
how all of those engagements unfold.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.050
We cannot know what situation
we may encounter from here on out.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.850
Have my lord stay in Kai,
so that he is free to act as needed.

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.420
Got it! I'll tell him you said so.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.300
Look at you now, all decisive and dependable.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.850
So you were alive, Lord Masamune.

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:40.270
It looks like Takenaka Hanbei's going to try

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:43.150
to commandeer Mori's fortress, but...

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.070
Master, did you see any of Toyotomi's troops?

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.490
I doubt he could easily commandeer that thing...

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:49.360
What?

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.780
Sasuke, what kind of terrain lies ahead of us?

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.740
We must stop that thing at all costs!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:59.950
Master Hanbei! Master Hanbei!

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.580
The advance party has been
defeated by Mori's fortress!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:09.210
So, you failed, my dear boy Akagawa.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.850
You.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:30.700
We meet at last, wild monkey Toyotomi!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:34.400
How about we say the winner
gets to go into this castle?

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:37.910
If you're out taking down other
places at the same time, it's perfect.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:41.040
I, the One-Eyed Dragon, will take it all

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.620
and the Date of Oshu will
have conquered the country.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:48.050
You do not have even a one in a
million chance of winning against me.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:53.850
Have you forgotten that you
narrowly escaped death twice?

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:57.100
You're the one who failed to take me down.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:00.350
That military coat of yours
that Hanbei put a gash in...

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:04.430
I will make it a shuddering funeral shroud for you!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.480
That's just perfect.

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:09.280
I'm always wearing my shroud!

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:10.820
Come on!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:44.950
You can't carry this
country with strength alone.

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:46.280
Once the heavens are
rent asunder, race up there!

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:51.460
Even if it's strength driven by darkness.

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:53.130
Sword Summit!

00:23:53.220 --> 00:23:56.010
I'll be keeping it cool all the way to the end!
